     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, <div><br></div><div><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font size=\"2\">I have run sequenza for Whole genome sequencing data. </font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font size=\"2\">All WGS data generated error message.</font><br></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font size=\"2\">Below is the error message.<br></font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">test = sequenza.extract(data.file, verbose=FALSE, assembly = &quot;hg19&quot;)</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Warning: 8 parsing failures.</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">row<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>col<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>expected<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>actual<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>file</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span>  </span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>position<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>an integer position<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&#39;12NB.seqz.edit.gz&#39;</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span>  </span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>depth.normal<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>an integer<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>depth.normal<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&#39;12NB.seqz.edit.gz&#39;</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span>  </span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>depth.tumor<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>an integer<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>depth.tumor<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&#39;12NB.seqz.edit.gz&#39;</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span>  </span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>depth.ratio<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>a double<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>depth.ratio<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&#39;12NB.seqz.edit.gz&#39;</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span>  </span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Af<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>a double<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Af<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&#39;12NB.seqz.edit.gz&#39;</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">... ............ .......... ............ ...................</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">See problems(...) for more details.</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;min-height:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Error in <a href=\"http://seq.int\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://seq.int&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792481355608000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3pfXvo06WSzw-9sfhj42GG\">seq.int</a>(range.pos[1], range.pos[2], by = window.offset) :</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span>  </span>&#39;to&#39; must be a finite number</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">In addition: Warning messages:</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">1: In read_tokens_(data, tokenizer, col_specs, col_names, locale_,<span>  </span>:</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span>  </span>NAs introduced by coercion to integer range</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">2: In min(x) : no non-missing arguments to min; returning Inf</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">3: In max(x) : no non-missing arguments to max; returning -Inf</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Please let me know how to fix the error.</span></font><br></p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Thank you.</span></font></p></div></div>"
